------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Build-time dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The media layer (lambda/media_layer/requirements.txt) installs Pillow and
pillow-heif from PyPI when the CDK stack is synthesized; neither is part of this
repository. The pillow-heif source is BSD-3-Clause, but its prebuilt Linux
wheels bundle libheif and libde265 (LGPLv3) and x265 (GPLv2) as shared
libraries, and the wheel's LICENSES_bundled.txt states that the license for the
binary wheels is GPLv2 "due to base library licenses". Pillow's wheels also
bundle shared libraries; their notices are in the wheel's LICENSE file. If you
share the built layer or the deployed Lambda package with anyone else, review
those licenses first.

